From da2c55ba8479930945481151a57e9caa3bcdc1c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:21:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 40/42] overlays: add icon shape overlays matching the launcher
 shapes

launcher3 keeps its icon shape in its own prefs since android 16, so
the framework mask stays a circle and every other app (settings app
list, share sheet, recents) keeps drawing circles. there are no
adaptive_icon_shape overlays in the tree either.

add one overlay per non-circle launcher shape with the same path, so
the launcher can select it through the theme customization setting.
---
